---
---

<div class="interactive-workflow" data-interactive-tabs aria-label="Interactive workflow example">
  <div class="tab-nav" role="tablist" aria-label="Workflow stages">
    <button
      id="tab-btn-delegate"
      class="tab-btn is-active"
      type="button"
      role="tab"
      aria-selected="true"
      aria-controls="tab-panel-delegate"
      tabindex="0"
      data-tab-target="tab-panel-delegate"
    >
      <strong>1. Delegate</strong>
      <span>Route to specialized capability</span>
    </button>
    <button
      id="tab-btn-compare"
      class="tab-btn"
      type="button"
      role="tab"
      aria-selected="false"
      aria-controls="tab-panel-compare"
      tabindex="-1"
      data-tab-target="tab-panel-compare"
    >
      <strong>2. Compare</strong>
      <span>Parallel candidate synthesis</span>
    </button>
    <button
      id="tab-btn-verify"
      class="tab-btn"
      type="button"
      role="tab"
      aria-selected="false"
      aria-controls="tab-panel-verify"
      tabindex="-1"
      data-tab-target="tab-panel-verify"
    >
      <strong>3. Verify</strong>
      <span>Executable tests & machine evidence</span>
    </button>
    <button
      id="tab-btn-iterate"
      class="tab-btn"
      type="button"
      role="tab"
      aria-selected="false"
      aria-controls="tab-panel-iterate"
      tabindex="-1"
      data-tab-target="tab-panel-iterate"
    >
      <strong>4. Iterate</strong>
      <span>Autonomous finding correction</span>
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="tab-content">
    <div
      id="tab-panel-delegate"
      class="tab-panel is-active"
      data-tab-panel="tab-panel-delegate"
      role="tabpanel"
      aria-labelledby="tab-btn-delegate"
      tabindex="0"
    >
      <div class="run-card__header">
        <span>Assignment Resolver</span>
        <strong>Target Resolved: Codex Worker on MacBook Host</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="terminal-panel">
<code is:raw>// Cloud evaluates task requirements and routes to authorized Host
const target = await scheduler.resolveTarget({
  task: "Implement D1 durable transaction adapter",
  workspace: "ws_production",
  requiredCapabilities: ["filesystem", "d1_sqlite"]
});
// → Dispatched to MacBook Host (Status: Ready, Verified capability: filesystem)</code>
      </div>
      <p>Tasks declare execution requirements. Conclave Cloud matches them against online Hosts, installed Workers, and authorized Accounts without hardcoding model locations.</p>
    </div>

    <div
      id="tab-panel-compare"
      class="tab-panel"
      data-tab-panel="tab-panel-compare"
      role="tabpanel"
      aria-labelledby="tab-btn-compare"
      tabindex="0"
      hidden
    >
      <div class="run-card__header">
        <span>Multi-Worker Synthesis</span>
        <strong>Evaluating Candidate Implementations</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="terminal-panel">
<code is:raw>[Candidate A - OpenAI Worker]
+ Implements batch atomic statements with retry backoff.
[Candidate B - Claude Worker]
+ Implements write-ahead journal with rollback hooks.

// Synthesis Worker identifies edge cases in Candidate B
// Recommends: Merge atomic retry with rollback hooks</code>
      </div>
      <p>When solving hard problems, run diverse model capabilities in parallel. Conclave synthesizes their strengths and highlights architectural trade-offs.</p>
    </div>

    <div
      id="tab-panel-verify"
      class="tab-panel"
      data-tab-panel="tab-panel-verify"
      role="tabpanel"
      aria-labelledby="tab-btn-verify"
      tabindex="0"
      hidden
    >
      <div class="run-card__header">
        <span>Independent Verification</span>
        <strong>Machine-Verifiable Proof Collection</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="terminal-panel">
<code is:raw>✓ Test suite passed with executable proof
✓ Architecture boundary guard: 0 violations
✓ Credential isolation preserved
✓ Artifact generated: dist/adapter.mjs (SHA256 verified)</code>
      </div>
      <p>Never trust natural-language claims that "it works". Conclave executes real tests, collects machine evidence, and ensures deterministic completion.</p>
    </div>

    <div
      id="tab-panel-iterate"
      class="tab-panel"
      data-tab-panel="tab-panel-iterate"
      role="tabpanel"
      aria-labelledby="tab-btn-iterate"
      tabindex="0"
      hidden
    >
      <div class="run-card__header">
        <span>Correction Loop</span>
        <strong>Finding Remediation & Reverification</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="terminal-panel">
<code is:raw>[Finding] Reviewer noted edge case on lock release
[Correction] Task dispatched to Worker with review finding
[Patch Applied] Lock lease timeout bounded safely
[Reverification] Test suite passed on reverification cycle</code>
      </div>
      <p>When a reviewer or test finds an issue, Conclave feeds the exact findings back into a focused correction task and reverifies the result.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
